# Avengers Assemble!: "At the beginning of each end step, if you attacked with a Hero this turn or a Hero entered the
# battlefield under your control this turn, draw a card." It triggers at the opponent's end step too (CR 513.1, "each end
# step"). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and on turn 2 flashes in Night Nurse (a Hero) in Bot2's second main phase. In Bot2's end
# step the trigger goes on the stack and Bot2 Disenchants the Avengers in response: the ability exists apart from its
# source (CR 113.7a) and its condition, checked again as it resolves (CR 603.4), is still true, so Bot1 draws its first
# card of the game. The Nurse is a plain 2/1 again with the Avengers gone.

